    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classRose_1_1Combinatorics_1_1Hasher_1_1HasherFactory" kindref="compound">HasherFactory</ref> is a singleton that creates and returns Hashers by name</para><para><ref refid="classRose_1_1Combinatorics_1_1Hasher" kindref="compound">Hasher</ref> factory contains a map of names to <ref refid="classRose_1_1Combinatorics_1_1Hasher_1_1HasherMaker" kindref="compound">HasherMaker</ref> . When createHasher is passed a name, it will attempt to create the correct <ref refid="classRose_1_1Combinatorics_1_1Hasher" kindref="compound">Hasher</ref> and pass it back. <linebreak/>
Users can add Hashers to <ref refid="classRose_1_1Combinatorics_1_1Hasher_1_1HasherFactory" kindref="compound">HasherFactory</ref> using . <ref refid="classRose_1_1Combinatorics_1_1Hasher_1_1HasherFactory" kindref="compound">HasherFactory</ref> is created when Instance is first called. Generally this is done at module initialization time. </para>    </detaileddescription>
